(7217927, 1112700, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  Hard to tell if it''s "late night" or just after sunset from the glow.  But since I can''t tell I''ll let it slide.  ;)  Really nice composition and processing.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  Hard to tell if it''s "late night" or just after sunset from the glow.  But since I can''t tell I''ll let it slide.  ;)  Really nice composition and processing.', '2014-05-18 09:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
